{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat Isle is a cozy pixel art management game inspired by Japan\u2019s famous Cat Islands. You\u2019ll build and expand a tiny train platform island in the middle of the sea, turning it into lively town for cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018550/extras/afd28e6866d049bbd5c8afe3d77eefb6.poster.avif?t=1769089081\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018550/extras/afd28e6866d049bbd5c8afe3d77eefb6.webm?t=1769089081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018550/extras/afd28e6866d049bbd5c8afe3d77eefb6.mp4?t=1769089081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage shops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running a town full of curious cats takes careful observation. While some cats seek out fresh sashimi, others are happiest with tea and a nap in the sun. As the island's caretaker, it\u2019s your job to figure out who wants what and create the perfect mix and balance of shop supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018550/extras/af66f1d3a094c39b9f814e634e2e0527.poster.avif?t=1769089081\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018550/extras/af66f1d3a094c39b9f814e634e2e0527.webm?t=1769089081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018550/extras/af66f1d3a094c39b9f814e634e2e0527.mp4?t=1769089081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorate your town</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each building is a chance to get creative. Add plants, lights and decorations to suit both your vision and your cats personalities. Every small detail matters, adding warmth to the town and helping your shops thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018550/extras/ac40bca0c0ea5a625d4b8dd53cd2c5e9.poster.avif?t=1769089081\" width=1170 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018550/extras/ac40bca0c0ea5a625d4b8dd53cd2c5e9.webm?t=1769089081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018550/extras/ac40bca0c0ea5a625d4b8dd53cd2c5e9.mp4?t=1769089081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vibe and chill</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, remember to slow down and enjoy the world you\u2019ve built. Watch the cats explore, play, and relax. Sometimes, just observing is the sweetest reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018550/extras/67d70e2a6e30c8458c6ad1f36b432be0.poster.avif?t=1769089081\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018550/extras/67d70e2a6e30c8458c6ad1f36b432be0.webm?t=1769089081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018550/extras/67d70e2a6e30c8458c6ad1f36b432be0.mp4?t=1769089081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 levels with unique goals and themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-4 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your cozy town with a variety of shops and buildings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate each building to match your taste and cat needs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover residents favorite meals, drinks and activities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage shops supply, demand, and the quirks of cat customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of cats</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018550?t=1769089081","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018550?t=1769089081","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018550/cfd218c05adbf9a0c3f0d1144c392c0d38d7c4fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769089081","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018550/cfd218c05adbf9a0c3f0d1144c392c0d38d7c4fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769089081","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat Isle is a cozy pixel art management game inspired by Japan\u2019s famous Cat Islands. You\u2019ll build and expand a tiny train platform island in the middle of the sea, turning it into lively town for cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018550/extras/afd28e6866d049bbd5c8afe3d77eefb6.poster.avif?t=1769089081\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018550/extras/afd2